s $A=[\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}].$\n\nComputing the determinant of $A,$ we get\n\n$$\ndet(A)=|\\begin{aligned}1 & 5 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}|=1\\cdot 0-(-1)\\cdot 5=5.\n$$\n\nSo, the area scale factor of the transformation is\n\n$$\n|det(A)|=|5|=5.\n$$" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303976 13194139534696 true] [17592186303975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303977 13194139534696 true] [17592186303975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303978 13194139534696 true] [17592186303975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303979 13194139534696 true] [17592186303975 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303980 13194139534696 true] [17592186303975 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534696 true] [17592186303975 1041 "selection" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303975 1104 #edb/ref 17592186303980 13194139534696 true] [17592186303975 1110 #uuid "6cbf72d4-ff11-5a9e-b815-b69cbe2d55d5" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303976 1034 "6" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303976 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534696 true] [17592186303976 1111 #uuid "7d8349db-d2bb-5f93-80a1-d479ceb0dab4" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303977 1034 "1" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303977 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534696 true] [17592186303977 1111 #uuid "662701fc-446c-569c-8817-4f15ab51d735" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303978 1034 "4" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303978 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534696 true] [17592186303978 1111 #uuid "a514b866-6d7b-51b3-abb0-24357f396e2f" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303979 1034 "0" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303979 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534696 true] [17592186303979 1111 #uuid "d9084e0a-b214-582c-b727-c03c4e4f2f3c" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303980 1034 "5" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303980 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139534696 true] [17592186303980 1111 #uuid "932fbc85-6f2e-5834-9234-7f7757fb98bc" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303981 1017 #edb/ref 17592186303982 13194139534696 true] [17592186303981 1089 "q-162195" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303981 1091 #edb/ref 17592186045465 13194139534696 true] [17592186303981 1100 "Consider the affine transformation $T,$ defined as\n\n$$\nx=2u-2v-3,\\,y=u-v+2.\n$$\n\nWhat is the area scale factor of the transformation?" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303981 1113 #uuid "52780571-6d1c-586f-ab0a-dbad6ab068ef" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303981 1145 "An affine transformation $T:{R}^{2}\\to {R}^{2}$ is a function of the form\n\n$$\nx=Au+b,\n$$\n\nwhere $x,u,$ and $b$ are column vectors in ${R}^{2},$ and $A$ is a $2\\times 2$ matrix.\n\nNotice that the given transformation can be expressed as\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}] & =[\\begin{aligned}2u-2v-3 \\\\ u-v+2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}2u-2v \\\\ u-v\\end{aligned}]+[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={{[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{A}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}u \\\\ v\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{u}+{{[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{b}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the matrix representation of the linear transformation associated with $T$ is $A=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}].$\n\nComputing the determinant of $A,$ we get\n\n$$\ndet(A)=|\\begin{aligned}2 & -2 \\\\ 1 & -1\\end{aligned}|=2\\cdot (-1)-1\\cdot (-2)=0.\n$$\n\nSo, the area scale factor of the transformation is\n\n$$\n|det(A)|=|0|=0.\n$$" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303983 13194139534696 true] [17592186303982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303984 13194139534696 true] [17592186303982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303985 13194139534696 true] [17592186303982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303986 13194139534696 true] [17592186303982 1000 #edb/ref 17592186303987 13194139534696 true] [17592186303982 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139534696 true] [17592186303982 1041 "selection" 13194139534696 true] [17592186303982 1104 #edb/ref 17592186303986 13194139534696 true] [17592186303982 1110 #uuid "1cec7d97-c8e5-5fb8-9720-b